  "critical": false,
  "description": "Semiconductor fabrication equipment demands elastomeric seals, gaskets, O-rings, and liners that withstand aggressive chemicals (HF, H\u2082SO\u2084, HNO\u2083, H\u2083PO\u2084, organic solvents), elevated temperatures, vacuum integrity, and ultra-clean conditions where a single particle or trace contaminant can destroy a wafer. Material selection is critical \u2014 the wrong elastomer in a wet bench can leach metal ions into the process stream, killing device yield. Standard rubber (NR, NBR) degrades rapidly in oxidizing...",
